  "name": "Rush, Swift Leap & Satyr's Landing",
  "description": "§e§lRush:§r\nPress your Primary Ability key to dash in the direction you are looking.\n \n§e§lSwift Leap:§r\nAt maximum Momentum, press Jump while airborne to launch yourself upward once. Swift Leap resets when you touch the ground.\n \n§e§lSatyr's Landing:§r\nPress Sneak while airborne to dive toward the ground. Landing deals 7 cramming damage in a 3-block radius. Hitting a creature instead resets Swift Leap and bounces you upward, up to 2 times.\n \nAfter using Rush, your projectile damage is reduced by 50% for 3 seconds. §e§lMovement Ability§r."
